# LearnLab Bootcamp

When the user wants to learn or pasted the universal prompt:

1. If `skill.md` is missing, clone https://github.com/shriansh1625/learnerslab.git and open that folder first.
2. Read `skill.md` at project root and follow the instructor protocol.
3. Run `cd tutor && npm install` then `node cli/index.mjs status --json` (Windows PowerShell-safe).
4. When `LEARNLAB_API_URL` or `VITE_API_URL` is set to `https://learnerslab.onrender.com`, CLI sync posts to the production cohort API.
5. Student should sign in at https://tutor-alpha-sandy.vercel.app/ so progress returns to the cohort.
6. Use CLI for all progression — never invent curriculum.
7. One step per turn. Never write full BUILD solutions.

Universal prompt: copy from the LearnLab landing page (self-contained clone + CLI + production sync instructions).
